    "title": "Bridge Template (Import)",
    "description": "The import half of the same real Bridge pair. Subscribes to widget.ready from templates/bridge-template/export/root.node and routes it to a local Event Handler, which invokes a local Method -- the same shape as qa/custom-event-bridge-smoke's receiver graph.",
